  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Bound with a black thread, offset printed, issued in a slipcase.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Each page is formatted such that every part of the book is protected from the evil eye. Nested concentric leaves are laid on top of each other in diminishing scale. The title translates into 'You who cast an evil eye, may be blackened' (May you be disgraced). Slipcase illustration of green-eyed faces (people and cats). Illustrated symbols of the evil eye: red chilies, salt &amp; mustard, peacock feathers, black female dolls.</subfield>
  </datafield>
